{"ref":"BDB, טוֹבִיָּ֫הוּ","hw":"טוֹבִיָּ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבִיָּ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Yah</em>(<em>u</em>) <em>is my good</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבִיָּהוּ</span> a Levite, assigned to reign of Jehoshaphat <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.8\">2 Ch 17:8</a>, not 𝔊; 𝔊L Τωβιας, elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבִיָּה</span> 𝔊 Τωβια(ς).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Ammonite adversary of Nehem. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.10\">Ne 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.35\">3:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.1\">4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.1\">6:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.4\">13:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.8\">8</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  head of a family of returning exiles of doubtful lineage <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:60\" href=\"/Ezra.2.60\">Ezr 2:60</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:61\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.61\">Ne 7:62</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a chief of returning exiles <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.10\">Zc 6:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.14\">14</a>, 𝔊 χρησίμων (-μοις) αὐτῆς, i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבֶיהָ</span>.","next":"BDB, טוֹב⁴","prev":"BDB, טוֹבָה"}